NOTE ON CODE
Creative Commons licences are designed for content rather than software. The
code here is offered under the same non-commercial terms for simplicity. If a
stricter, software-specific equivalent is ever needed, PolyForm Noncommercial
1.0.0 is the closer instrument.

SOURCES
Every recipe cites a source, most often Wikipedia, which is itself CC BY-SA.
Cited articles remain under their own licences; this licence covers the graph,
the explanations written for it, and the tooling around it.
